WEBVTT

00:11.336 --> 00:15.129
<i>And now back to
The World of Gross Sea Life.</i>
<i>现在回到
海洋生物的世界。</i>

00:15.232 --> 00:18.646
<i>Observe how this ingenious
parasitic isopod</i>
<i>观察这个巧妙的
寄生等足类动物</i>

00:18.750 --> 00:23.784
<i>finds a new home by attaching
itself inside a fish's mouth,</i>
<i>通过附着找到新家
本身在鱼嘴里，</i>

00:23.887 --> 00:26.232
<i>becoming its new tongue.</i>
<i>成为它的新语言。</i>

00:26.336 --> 00:27.405
Hmm?
唔？

00:28.370 --> 00:32.474
That's the most disgusting thing
I've ever seen.
这才是最恶心的事
我曾经见过。

00:33.750 --> 00:37.439
Disgustingly genius!
令人厌恶的天才！

00:37.543 --> 00:40.129
It's giving me a wonderful idea!
它给了我一个绝妙的主意！

00:40.232 --> 00:43.715
I'll glue myself
to SpongeBob's tongue!
我会把自己粘起来
海绵宝宝的舌头！

00:43.818 --> 00:46.750
By hiding right in
that fry cook's face,
通过隐藏在
炸厨师的脸，

00:46.853 --> 00:48.853
I'll be in the perfect position
我会处于完美的位置

00:48.956 --> 00:51.543
to collect
a Krabby Patty sample!
收集
蟹肉饼样品！

00:58.750 --> 01:01.267
Well, what could possibly
go wrong?
嗯，什么可能
出问题了吗？

01:03.784 --> 01:06.198
Clever disguise? Check.
巧妙的伪装？查看。

01:06.301 --> 01:08.336
Sample container? Check.
样品容器？查看。

01:08.508 --> 01:10.060
Glue? Check.
胶水？查看。

01:10.232 --> 01:14.405
Time to begin
operation tongue oppressor!
开始时间
压舌器手术！

01:19.715 --> 01:22.784
An iron a day
keeps the wrinkles away!
一天一熨斗
让皱纹远离！

01:25.784 --> 01:28.405
Ooh. I hope it's a salesman!
哦。希望是个推销员！

01:28.991 --> 01:30.577
Candy-gram!
糖果克！

01:30.956 --> 01:35.198
Ooh! I just love
a Poetry-Slam Candy-gram!
哦！我就是爱
诗歌大满贯糖果克！

01:35.301 --> 01:37.681
Poetry? Well, okay.
诗？好吧，好吧。

01:37.922 --> 01:40.922
Roses are red, candy is sweet.
玫瑰是红的，糖果是甜的。

01:41.025 --> 01:44.715
Uh, eat with your mouth,
not with your feet?
嗯，用嘴吃饭
不是用脚吗？

01:46.543 --> 01:48.163
Words to live by.
赖以生存的话。

01:53.784 --> 01:57.784
That's it! Eat the
delicious little plankton.
就是这样！吃
美味的小浮游生物。

01:57.887 --> 02:00.232
I'll just have one little candy.
我只要一颗小糖果。

02:03.784 --> 02:04.681
Who am I kidding?
我在跟谁开玩笑呢？

02:07.474 --> 02:10.474
Come on, you dolt! Eat me.
来吧，你这个笨蛋！吃我吧

02:13.129 --> 02:17.129
Ooh. This pink candy
looks so delicious...
哦。这颗粉色的糖果
看起来很好吃...

02:17.232 --> 02:19.543
Yes. Yes.
是的。是的。

02:19.784 --> 02:22.025
That I saved it just
for you, Gary!
我刚刚保存了它
为了你，加里！

02:31.163 --> 02:32.853
Ugh.
啊。

02:35.301 --> 02:38.956
I have to get inside
that mouth breather's mouth.
我必须进去
那个呼吸者的嘴。

02:39.060 --> 02:41.922
Maybe disguise myself
as a door to door dentist?
也许伪装自己
作为上门牙医？

02:42.439 --> 02:44.060
No, that's not a thing.
不，那不是一件事。

02:45.887 --> 02:48.336
Ew! I stepped in some old gum!
呃！我踩到了一些旧口香糖！

03:06.784 --> 03:09.853
And now, I just have
to glue myself
而现在，我只有
把我自己粘起来

03:09.956 --> 03:12.060
to his hideous tongue.
到他那可怕的舌头。

03:15.612 --> 03:18.129
Come on. Whoops!
快点。哎呀！

03:20.577 --> 03:21.715
Yes!
是的！

03:24.370 --> 03:25.474
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

03:25.577 --> 03:28.060
"The Tiny Book
of Tortuous Tongue Twisters."
《小书
曲折的绕口令。”

03:28.163 --> 03:30.577
Perfect for my morning
exercises.
非常适合我的早晨
练习。

03:30.681 --> 03:33.646
My tongue has to be in tip top
shape to taste my patties.
我的舌头必须处于顶端
形状来品尝我的肉饼。

03:33.750 --> 03:35.370
Tongue twisters?
绕口令？

03:35.474 --> 03:37.543
"The squad of odd cod
“奇怪的鳕鱼小队

03:37.646 --> 03:40.508
applaud the sassy cephalopod."
为时髦的头足类动物鼓掌。”

03:40.612 --> 03:42.612
The pain! Huh?
痛苦！啊？

03:44.681 --> 03:47.508
This dream scheme
gone full steam
这个梦想计划
全速前进

03:47.612 --> 03:50.163
guarantees Eugene's screams.
保证了尤金的尖叫声。

03:50.681 --> 03:52.922
Oh, boy. Now, I'm doing it.
哦，男孩。现在，我正在做。

03:54.163 --> 03:55.853
Morning, Squidward.
早上好，章鱼哥。

04:03.129 --> 04:06.405
Ugh. Your breath
smells like chum.
啊。你的呼吸
闻起来像密友。

04:12.094 --> 04:13.508
It is a bit stinky.
有点臭。

04:16.301 --> 04:18.543
You try passing through
a snail's intestines
你尝试穿越
蜗牛的肠子

04:18.646 --> 04:20.129
and see what you smell like!
看看你闻起来是什么味道！

04:20.232 --> 04:22.405
A little breath spray
should help.
一点呼吸喷雾
应该有帮助。

04:28.784 --> 04:31.543
Better get some patties out of
the freezer for today's orders.
最好拿出一些肉饼
存放今天订单的冰箱。

04:34.750 --> 04:37.612
Oh, no! We're out of patties!
哦，不！我们的肉饼没了！

04:37.715 --> 04:39.301
Of course, you are.
当然，你是。

04:39.405 --> 04:42.543
Which means I get to make
a whole new batch!
这意味着我可以做
全新一批！

04:42.646 --> 04:43.922
Hooray!
万岁！

04:44.956 --> 04:46.301
Even better!
甚至更好！

04:46.405 --> 04:49.681
I'll have a front-row seat
to the whole process.
我会坐在前排
到整个过程。

04:53.232 --> 04:55.508
A little secret ingredient A.
一点秘密成分A。

04:55.612 --> 04:57.956
Secret ingredient A?
秘密成分A？

04:59.715 --> 05:01.612
Two plops of B.
两声扑通 B.

05:03.094 --> 05:06.543
Some C, D, E, and G!
一些 C、D、E 和 G！

05:08.129 --> 05:10.646
Two cups of this! A jar of that!
两杯这个！一罐那个！

05:11.129 --> 05:13.715
And just a pinch of Z.
还有一点Z。

05:14.198 --> 05:16.784
What's this guy making?
Alphabet soup?
这家伙在做什么？
字母汤？

05:16.887 --> 05:18.405
Mix well.
搅拌均匀。

05:22.750 --> 05:23.681
Perfect!
完美的！

05:23.784 --> 05:24.784
Now for the taste test.
现在进行口味测试。

05:24.887 --> 05:26.543
That's it, baby.
就是这样，宝贝。

05:26.646 --> 05:29.060
I only need one sample.
我只需要一份样品。

05:32.750 --> 05:33.853
My eye!
我的眼睛！

05:33.956 --> 05:36.681
Ugh. These patties
are kind of bland.
啊。这些肉饼
有点平淡。

05:36.784 --> 05:38.370
I can't taste them at all.
我根本尝不出它们的味道。

05:38.474 --> 05:40.715
Time to get a little creative.
是时候发挥一点创意了。

05:40.956 --> 05:43.336
Hmm, maybe some
Limburger cheese will help.
嗯，也许有一些
林堡奶酪会有帮助。

05:43.922 --> 05:46.646
Oh, no. Not Limburger.
哦，不。不是林堡。

05:53.681 --> 05:55.163
Still blah.
还是废话。

05:55.267 --> 05:57.370
Ooh! How about
a little sauerkraut?
哦！怎么样
一点酸菜？

05:58.129 --> 05:59.750
Flying Dutchman peppers.
飞翔的荷兰人辣椒。

05:59.853 --> 06:01.612
And this old jar of toe jam.
还有这罐旧脚趾酱。

06:05.301 --> 06:08.094
Good, Neptune.
Not in your mouth!
很好，海王星。
不在你嘴里！

06:15.922 --> 06:17.439
Still doesn't have any taste.
还是没有什么味道。

06:18.336 --> 06:20.991
Oh. I've made a critical error.
哦。我犯了一个严重错误。

06:21.094 --> 06:24.267
My glue has covered
that dolt's taste buds.
我的胶水已经覆盖了
那个笨蛋的味蕾。

06:24.370 --> 06:26.301
Get a move on, SpongeBob!
继续前进吧，海绵宝宝！

06:26.405 --> 06:27.956
The orders are piling up!
订单堆积如山！

06:28.060 --> 06:29.750
No problem, Squidward.
没问题，章鱼哥。

06:29.922 --> 06:31.646
I guess
it'll have to do.
我猜
必须这样做。

06:31.750 --> 06:34.646
The Krabby Patties are ready,
Squidward.
蟹黄饼就做好了
章鱼哥。

06:34.750 --> 06:35.646
Whatever.
任何。

06:38.301 --> 06:41.267
Thank Neptune. I'm starving.
感谢海王星。我饿死了。

06:41.370 --> 06:42.508
Finally.
最后。

06:44.129 --> 06:47.750
Is this even food?
这还是食物吗？

06:53.094 --> 06:56.750
Ew! This is disgusting!
呃！这太恶心了！

06:58.991 --> 07:00.887
I'll never eat here again!
我再也不会在这里吃饭了！

07:00.991 --> 07:02.750
I've had better garbage!
我吃过更好的垃圾！

07:02.853 --> 07:05.163
It tastes worse than chum!
味道比密友还差！

07:05.991 --> 07:07.267
Hmm.
唔。

07:08.129 --> 07:10.370
Worse than chum?
比密友还糟糕？

07:17.922 --> 07:20.750
What have you done
to my patties?
你做了什么
到我的肉饼？

07:24.853 --> 07:26.577
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

07:26.681 --> 07:29.060
The patties
have no flavor at all today.
肉饼
今天一点味道都没有。

07:29.163 --> 07:30.267
No flavor?
没有味道？

07:30.370 --> 07:32.232
More like too much flavor!
更像是味道太多了！

07:32.336 --> 07:35.336
They taste like the
Flying Dutchman's long johns!
它们的味道就像
飞翔的荷兰人的秋裤！

07:37.301 --> 07:39.784
I'm afraid your taste buds
are worn out, boy-o.
我担心你的味蕾
都累坏了，小伙子。

07:40.267 --> 07:41.336
Phew.
唷。

07:41.439 --> 07:43.094
Until your tongue recovers,
直到你的舌头恢复正常

07:43.198 --> 07:44.784
you're off grill duty.
你已经下班了。

07:44.887 --> 07:46.750
Turn in your hat and spatula.
交出你的帽子和抹刀。

07:51.439 --> 07:53.646
Aww.
哇。

07:56.232 --> 07:59.025
That's one more
for the failure pile.
这还有一个
为失效桩。

07:59.232 --> 08:01.439
Time to abandon tongue.
是时候放弃舌头了。

08:06.232 --> 08:07.956
Ah, blast.
啊，爆炸。

08:08.060 --> 08:09.715
The zipper's covered in glue.
拉链上沾满了胶水。

08:11.853 --> 08:15.577
Huh. My left armpit
still sounds a little sharp.
呵呵。我的左腋下
听起来还是有点尖锐。

08:21.887 --> 08:23.129
That's better.
这样更好。

08:23.750 --> 08:24.784
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

08:24.887 --> 08:26.094
Hey, Patrick.
嘿，帕特里克。

08:26.198 --> 08:27.232
What's the matter?
怎么了？

08:27.336 --> 08:29.922
I can't taste a thing.
我尝不出任何东西的味道。

08:30.025 --> 08:31.474
My tongue is broken.
我的舌头断了。

08:31.577 --> 08:34.232
He goes to Patrick for advice?
他去找帕特里克寻求建议？

08:34.336 --> 08:36.370
It's the nitwits
leading the dimwits.
这是一群白痴
带领愚人。

08:36.474 --> 08:38.784
Your tongue's
probably just dirty.
你的舌头
可能只是脏了。

08:38.887 --> 08:41.232
That happens to me all the time.
这种事经常发生在我身上。

08:43.474 --> 08:47.094
You're the smartest
smart person who ever smarted!
你是最聪明的
曾经聪明过的聪明人！

08:47.198 --> 08:49.612
Give me a little run off music,
maestro!
给我一点音乐，
大师！

08:56.750 --> 08:58.129
- Ahh.
- Sweet Neptune!
- 啊。
- 甜蜜的海王星！

08:58.232 --> 09:00.198
No!
不！

09:08.163 --> 09:10.991
I need
something stronger.
我需要
更强大的东西。

09:13.129 --> 09:14.508
This should do the trick!
这应该可以解决问题！

09:15.715 --> 09:16.750
Ahh!
啊！

09:36.025 --> 09:39.129
May I borrow
your hat, sir?
我可以借用吗
先生，你的帽子吗？

09:39.232 --> 09:40.750
Oh, of course!
哦，当然！

09:42.025 --> 09:44.750
It tastes like emptiness.
尝起来就像是空虚。

09:47.887 --> 09:49.784
Tastes fine to me.
对我来说味道不错。

09:52.198 --> 09:55.060
Oh, my poor tongue
is just worn out.
哦，我可怜的舌头
只是破旧了。

09:55.474 --> 09:57.370
Guess it's time for a new one!
猜猜是时候换新的了！

09:57.474 --> 09:58.370
What?
什么？

09:59.750 --> 10:01.370
Ahh.
啊。

10:09.818 --> 10:11.198
Silly me.
愚蠢的我。

10:11.301 --> 10:12.887
Why didn't I do this earlier?
我为什么不早点这样做呢？

10:15.956 --> 10:18.853
Can I borrow that
dirty old tongue of yours?
我可以借那个吗
你那脏兮兮的老舌头？

10:18.956 --> 10:20.301
Of course!
当然！

10:22.439 --> 10:25.025
Patrick eats more
Krabby Patties than anyone.
帕特里克吃得更多
蟹肉饼比任何人都多。

10:25.129 --> 10:27.750
Why didn't I do this earlier?
我为什么不早点这样做呢？

10:28.405 --> 10:30.646
Sorry, my old tongue's
a little loud.
抱歉，我的老舌头
有点大声。

10:30.750 --> 10:31.956
That's okay.
没关系。

10:35.301 --> 10:36.508
Perfect.
完美的。

10:36.612 --> 10:39.232
I'm just gonna go grab
a bite to eat
我只是要去抢
吃一口

10:39.336 --> 10:42.750
at the annual
Chum Eating Contest!
在每年的
密友吃比赛！

10:42.853 --> 10:45.094
Chum eating contest?
密友吃比赛？

10:45.198 --> 10:46.612
Was that today?
那是今天吗？

10:46.715 --> 10:48.508
On your marks,
在你的标记上，

10:48.612 --> 10:50.025
get set,
准备好，

10:50.129 --> 10:51.060
chum!
密友！

10:54.198 --> 10:58.336
Aw. Why can't I have
a detachable tongue?
噢。为什么我不能拥有
可拆卸的舌头？

噢。为什么我不能拥有
可拆卸的舌头？